<title>UK: BASKETBALL-LATEST EUROLEAGUE STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>BASKETBALL-LATEST EUROLEAGUE STANDINGS.</headline>
<text>
<p>LONDON, Feb 12 Reuter) - Men's EuroLeague basketball</p>
<p>standings after Wednesday's matches:</p>
<p>Group G</p>
<p> Panathinaikos (Greece)	    15  12   3   27</p>
<p> Villeurbanne (France)	     14  10   4   24</p>
<p> Ljubljana (Slovenia)		15   9   6   24</p>
<p> Sevilla (Spain)		     15   7   8   22</p>
<p> Pau-Orthez (France)		 15   6   9   21</p>
<p> Dynamo Moscow (Russia)	    14   3  11   17</p>
<p>Group H</p>
<p> Efes Pilsen (Turkey)		15  11   4   26</p>
<p> Barcelona (Spain)		   15   8   7   23</p>
<p> Partizan Belgrade (Yugoslavia)  15   8   7   23</p>
<p> Split (Croatia)		     15   7   8   22</p>
<p> Kinder Bologna (Italy)	    14   6   8   20</p>
<p> Bayer Leverkusen (Germany)	14   1  13   15</p>
